{"toolCallId":"call_422c26a5df8e4b268023267d866e5870","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"specs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md:193:## 9. COMPLEXITY ASSESSMENT\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-194-\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-195-| Dimension | Score | Triggers |\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-196-|-----------|-------|----------|\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-197-| Scope | 12/25 | Files: about 70 read, 0 changed outside this folder. Systems: templates, references, router |\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-198-| Risk | 6/25 | Auth: N, API: N, Breaking: N |\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-199-| Research | 14/20 | Full census of three directories plus a model baseline |\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-200-| Multi-Agent | 12/15 | Workstreams: 3 census lanes, 3 baseline runs, 1 review |\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-201-| Coordination | 8/15 | Dependencies: launch preconditions only |\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-202-| **Total** | **52/100** | **Level 3** |\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-203-\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-204----\nspecs/system-speckit/054-weak-model-spec-authoring/001-template-drift-census-and-baseline/spec.md-205-\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/222-deepseek-baseline","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"32b1d4","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
{"toolCallId":"call_42da6dbd659844cea516713c5eb8eaad","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"391-}\n392-\n393-// Mirrors the fingerprint-field pattern normalizeForContinuityFingerprint\n394:// (runtime/lib/validation/spec-doc-structure.ts) hashes past, so a value\n395-// stamped here reads back identical through CONTINUITY_FRESHNESS's own\n396-// recomputation. Duplicated rather than imported: that module lives outside\n397-// this package's runtime-API boundary. The value part accepts any sha256:\n398-// label, not only a hex digest, so a hand-written stamp can be replaced by\n399-// a real one instead of being left untouched forever.\n400-const SESSION_DEDUP_FINGERPRINT_LINE_RE = /^(\\s{6}fingerprint:\\s*)(?:[\"'])?sha256:[^\"'\\s#]+(?:[\"'])?(\\s*(?:#.*)?)$/m;\n401-\n402-/**\n403- * Stamp implementation-summary.md's `_memory.continuity.session_dedup.fingerprint`\n404- * with a real, content-derived value whenever the spec folder carries a\n405- * completion claim in any of the six COMPLETION_DOCS (continuity-freshness.ts's\n406- * attestation binding: implementation-summary.md is the sole document that\n407- * fingerprint is ever verified against), so a freshly saved completed packet\n408- * does not default into CONTINUITY_FRESHNESS's `missing_fingerprint`/\n409- * `zero_fingerprint` skip codes. The save runs it before the graph refresh,\n410- * because the summary is one of the documents the graph's source fingerprint\n411- * hashes: a stamp written after the refresh leaves that fingerprint stale. The\n412- * write replaces the file by a same-directory rename, so a crash mid-stamp\n413- * leaves the previous summary intact. A no-op when the\n414- * document has no session_dedup.fingerprint field to stamp, or when the\n415- * stored value already matches the recomputed one.\n416- */\n417-export function stampCompletionFingerprintIfNeeded(specFolderPath: string): void {\n418-  const summaryPath = path.join(specFolderPath, 'implementation-summary.md');\n419-  if (!fsSync.existsSync(summaryPath)) {\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.worktrees/222-deepseek-baseline","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"b2f875","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
