{"toolCallId":"call_710779485f0a414ba3696edc67fc175c","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"94:export function computeSourceDocHashes(folderPath: string): Record<string, string> {\n95-  const folder = path.resolve(folderPath);\n96-  const hashes: Record<string, string> = {};\n97-  for (const relativePath of SYNOPSIS_SOURCE_DOCS) {\n98-    const docPath = path.join(folder, relativePath);\n99-    let content: string;\n100-    try {\n101-      // A linked parent can expose another packet's source, so hash only local targets.\n102-      if (!isWithinPacketFolder(docPath, folder)) continue;\n103-      content = fs.readFileSync(docPath, 'utf-8');\n104-    } catch {\n105-      continue;\n106-    }\n107-    hashes[relativePath.replace(/\\\\/g, '/')] = crypto.createHash('sha256').update(content).digest('hex');\n108-  }\n109-  return hashes;\n110-}\n111-\n112-function isWithinPacketFolder(filePath: string, packetFolderPath: string): boolean {\n113-  try {\n114-    const realPacketFolderPath = fs.realpathSync(packetFolderPath);\n--\n246:  const currentHashes = computeSourceDocHashes(folder);\n247-  const storedHashes = graph ? readStoredSourceDocHashes(graph) : null;\n248-  const ungraded = storedHashes === null;\n249-  const hashDrift = storedHashes !== null && !hashMapsEqual(storedHashes, currentHashes);\n250-\n251-  // Cheap freshness key: when the persisted hashes match the current docs nothing changed,\n252-  // so the re-derive is skipped and no field drift is possible.\n253-  if (storedHashes !== null && !hashDrift) {\n254-    return {\n255-      rule: GENERATED_METADATA_DRIFT_RULE,\n256-      checked: true,\n257-      driftedFields: [],\n258-      hashDrift: false,\n259-      ungraded: false,\n260-      readErrors,\n261-    };\n262-  }\n263-\n--- dist module type ---\n// ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n// MODULE: Graph Metadata Parser\n// ──────────────────────────────────────────────────